{"ref":"BDB, יְרַקְרַק","hw":"יְרַקְרַק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְרַקְרַק</span></big>  (Sta<sup>§ 156, 234</sup>) <strong>adj. greenish, palegreen (</strong>cf. Assyrian <em>raḳraḳḳu</em>, Zim<sup>BP 37</sup><strong>)</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:49\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.49\">Lv 13:49</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:14\" href=\"/Psalms.68.14\">ψ 68:14</a>; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרַקְרַקּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.37\">Lv 14:37</a>;—of plague spots <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:49\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.49\">Lv 13:49</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.37\">14:37</a>; as subst., <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:14\" href=\"/Psalms.68.14\">ψ 68:14</a> the <em>green-shim-mering</em> (Che) of gold.","next":"BDB, יָרְקְעָ֑ם","prev":"BDB, יֵרָקוֹן"}